  <title>Paper published: STOKECAM stereo imaging system for overturning waves (Coastal Engineering Journal)</title>
  <link>https://tsampras.ucsd.edu/news/2026-11-paper-published-stokecam/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>Drew Davey’s paper with Falk Feddersen and Georgios, <em>A STereo imaging system for Overturning wave KinEmatiCs and dynAMics (STOKECAM)</em>, is now published open access in the <em>Coastal Engineering Journal</em>. The work is part of the Functional Surfing Reef project. Congratulations Drew!</p>
<p>Andrew S. Davey, Falk Feddersen, Georgios Tsampras (2026), A STereo imaging system for Overturning wave KinEmatiCs and dynAMics (STOKECAM), <em>Coastal Engineering Journal</em>, DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/21664250.2026.2762549">10.1080/21664250.2026.2762549</a></p>



