  <title>Wall panel test for the cut-and-cover tunnel project</title>
  <link>https://tsampras.ucsd.edu/news/2026-10-first-panel-test-for-cut-and-cover-tunnels/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>Following the two tunnel specimen tests, the Caltrans cut-and-cover tunnel project continued with tests of wall panel specimens that study improved shear tie details. The first panel specimen, which has the same shear ties as the tunnel specimens, was tested at the Powell Structural Systems Laboratories at UC San Diego on October 6, 2026. Priyana Rajbhandari designed the panel specimens. The project is led by P. Benson Shing (PI), with Ahmed Elgamal and Georgios Tsampras as Co-PIs.</p>
