<item>
  <title>Cyclic tests of uniform flexural link connections for mass timber braced frames</title>
  <link>https://tsampras.ucsd.edu/news/2026-09-cyclic-tests-of-uniform-flexural-link-connections/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>In August and September 2026, Fulbright Visiting Scholar Asad Naeem (University of Management and Technology, Lahore) tested uniform flexural link connections for mass timber braced frames in the Structural Research Laboratories at UC San Diego. The replaceable steel links, machined from standard steel angles, yielded uniformly and kept a stable response up to large deformations before fracture. Three-dimensional digital image correlation tracked the deformation of the links.</p>
