<item>
  <title>Cyclic tests of spring washer assemblies for the 230 kV transformer test</title>
  <link>https://tsampras.ucsd.edu/news/2026-08-spring-washer-testing-for-the-transformer-test/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>In preparation for the shake-table test of a 230 kV transformer, the group characterized the cyclic performance of Belleville spring washer assemblies. Different stack configurations were tested under uniaxial cyclic loading at frequencies from 0.1 to 4 Hz, using a test fixture designed and machined by the group. The results were shared with our project partners at WEGAI Research and Idaho National Laboratory.</p>
<p><a href="../../research/transformer-shake-table/index.html">Project page</a></p>
<p><img src="https://tsampras.ucsd.edu/news/2026-08-spring-washer-testing-for-the-transformer-test/photo-1.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Belleville spring washer stack in the uniaxial test fixture" width="480"></p>



